test calculations for matrix exponentials
and matrix products using lapack libraries.

the expokit lib for pade expm is much faster
than the c++ implementation. an eigenvalue
implementation combined with a list of pars
that is 10 or greater is the fastest.

for matrix products, there is a gain of about
30 from using dgemm directly from BLAS versus
rather than doing it via the uBLAS wrapper.
